sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant Agent as /api/agent
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant DB as Database
    participant LLM as GPT-4o

    User->>FE: Fill form (Chat Builder) OR type message OR upload file
    FE->>Agent: POST /api/agent/manual OR /chat OR /upload
    Agent->>DB: INSERT AgentSession {state=INIT, mode, user_id, raw_input}
    Agent->>Orch: spawn background task: run_pre_hitl(session_id)
    Agent-->>FE: {id, state=CLASSIFYING} immediate response

    Note over FE: Poll GET /api/agent/{id} every 1.8s

    Orch->>DB: UPDATE state=CLASSIFYING
    Orch->>Orch: InputClassifier.run() detect CHAT/DOC/MANUAL
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE state=PARSING
    Orch->>Orch: ParsingAgent.run() extract raw endpoints
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE state=SCHEMA_GENERATING, extracted_schema saved
    Orch->>LLM: SchemaAgent prompt → OpenAPI-compatible JSON
    LLM-->>Orch: {name, base_url, version, auth_type, endpoints[]}
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE state=CONFIDENCE_SCORING, draft_api saved
    Orch->>LLM: ConfidenceAgent prompt → score each field
    LLM-->>Orch: {confidence_map: {field: HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW|MISSING}}
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE state=HITL_PENDING, confidence_map saved

    FE->>Agent: GET /api/agent/{id}
    DB-->>FE: {state=HITL_PENDING, draft_api, confidence_map}
    FE-->>User: Show editor with confidence dots GREEN AMBER RED

    User->>FE: Review, edit fields, set auth credentials, click Save
    FE->>Agent: POST /api/agent/{id}/hitl {edits, auth_credentials}
    Agent->>Agent: encrypt_creds(auth_credentials)
    Agent->>DB: UPDATE session (human_edits, auth_credentials encrypted)
    Agent->>Orch: spawn background task: run_post_hitl(session_id)
    Agent-->>FE: {state=VALIDATING}

    Orch->>Orch: merge(draft_api, human_edits) → final_api
    Orch->>Orch: SchemaValidator.run() rule checks

    alt Validation fails
        Orch->>DB: UPDATE state=HITL_PENDING, validation_errors=[...]
        FE-->>User: Show errors, user must fix
    else Validation passes
        Orch->>DB: UPDATE state=API_TESTING
        Orch->>Orch: ApiTestAgent.run() HTTP call each endpoint
        Orch->>DB: UPDATE state=SAVING, api_test_results saved
        Orch->>DB: INSERT ApiDefinition + ApiEndpoint rows
        Orch->>DB: UPDATE session (state=SAVED, api_definition_id)
        FE-->>User: Success panel — API created
    end
